{"strongs": "H1240", "word": "ᵑ7", "translit": "be.qar", "root": "אול", "morph": "A:V", "pos": "verb Pa`el", "gloss": "inquire, seek", "definition": "[ בְּקַר ] verb Pa`el inquire, seek (only Ezra) ( ᵑ7 Syriac; see Biblical Hebrew); — Perfect 3 masculine plural בַּקַּ֫רוּ Dan 4:19 ; Dan 6:1 Imperfect 3 masculine singular יְבַקַּר Dan 4:15 Infinitive לְבַקָּרָה Dan 7:14 — 1. inquire , with עַל (of thing) concerning Dan 7:14 with subject indefinite, = passive, Dan 4:19 search was made , so Dan 6:1 ; Dan 4:15 . Hithpa. Imperfect 3 masculine singular יִתְבַּקַּר Dan 5:17 , impersonal, let search be made.", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9385')\">BDB9385</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1240')\">H1240</entry> <entry onclick=\"sn('H1239')\">H1239</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9384')\">BDB9384</entry> | BIBLICAL ARAMAIC | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB9386')\">BDB9386</entry></div><p> [<bdbarc>בְּקַר</bdbarc>] <b>verb Pa`el</b> <highlightword>inquire, seek</highlightword> (only Ezra) (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Tg')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵑ7</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> Syriac; see Biblical Hebrew); — <highlight>Perfect</highlight> 3 masculine plural <bdbarc>בַּקַּ֫רוּ</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,19)\">Dan 4:19</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 6:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,1)\">Dan 6:1</ref> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>יְבַקַּר</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 4:15\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,15)\">Dan 4:15</ref> <highlight>Infinitive</highlight> <bdbarc>לְבַקָּרָה</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,14)\">Dan 7:14</ref> — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>inquire</highlight>, with <bdbarc>עַל</bdbarc> (of thing) <highlight>concerning</highlight> <ref ref=\"Dan 7:14\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"14\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"14\" onclick=\"bcv(27,7,14)\">Dan 7:14</ref> with subject indefinite, = passive, <ref ref=\"Dan 4:19\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,19)\">Dan 4:19</ref> <highlight>search was made</highlight>, so <ref ref=\"Dan 6:1\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(27,6,1)\">Dan 6:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Dan 4:15\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(27,4,15)\">Dan 4:15</ref>. <b>Hithpa.</b> <highlight>Imperfect</highlight> 3 masculine singular <bdbarc>יִתְבַּקַּר</bdbarc> <ref ref=\"Dan 5:17\" b=\"27\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(27,5,17)\">Dan 5:17</ref>, impersonal, <highlight>let search be made.</highlight> </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Dan 4:19", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 19}, {"raw": "Dan 6:1", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 6, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Dan 4:15", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 4, "verse": 15}, {"raw": "Dan 7:14", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 7, "verse": 14}, {"raw": "Dan 5:17", "book": "DAN", "chapter": 5, "verse": 17}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["ᵑ7"], "aramaic": ["בְּקַר", "בַּקַּ֫רוּ", "יְבַקַּר", "לְבַקָּרָה", "עַל", "יִתְבַּקַּר"], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Tg"]}, "covers": ["H1240", "H1239"], "bdbid": "BDB9385", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}